**CM unit vector:** (M − C)/|MC| = (−11/16, 3√15/16) (verified: 121/256 + 135/256 = 1). Note |MB| = |MC| = 4√10/5, consistent with M being the midpoint of arc BC.

**AC direction:** (5√10/16, −√6/16). Reflecting about CM:
