- d'_C = (√10/32, −13√6/32) ✓ (unit vector: 10/1024 + 1014/1024 = 1)

## Finding D

Line from B: P = B + t·d'_B = (5√10/2 + t√10/8, √6/2 − 3t√6/8)

Line from C: P = C + u·d'_C = (15√10/4 + u√10/32, −3√6/4 − 13u√6/32)

**x-coordinates** (dividing by √10): 5/2 + t/8 = 15/4 + u/32 → 4t − u = 40 ... (I)

